	THE SCROLL — WEEKLY STACK
Surrender your heart. Strategize your week. Set your sights.
	

How to Use The Scroll
Use this at the start of each week — ideally in a quiet moment.
SURRENDER: Give what's on your mind to God/your higher power through four channels.
STRATEGIZE: Identify your course corrections — STOP, START, SUSTAIN.
Then apply your insight across the Core 4 domains.
	

PART 1 — SURRENDER
What do you want to share, ask, or communicate about your creativity today?
"GOD / HIGHER POWER, I want you to know…"
My Clear Head wants you to notice these Real Facts:


My Open Heart wants you to hear my Raw Feelings:


My Intuitive Gut senses this Relevant Focus:


My Engaged Hips desire to create this Resulting Fruit (concrete outcomes):


	

(Take a moment to breathe, be still, and listen… ready to continue?)
PART 2 — STRATEGIZE
From what you've seen, what course corrections do you want to make in your Creative Practice or Project?
START — Is there anything you want to START doing this week?


STOP — Is there anything you want to STOP doing this week?


SUSTAIN — Is there anything you want to SUSTAIN doing this week?




How will you measure success? What would it concretely look like?






What story must you tell yourself to assure that you do it?








PART 3 — INSIGHT
What is the most significant INSIGHT you are leaving with?






Would you like to apply this insight to any other area of your Core 4? If so, where?






