COMPLETION CODE
	RESISTANCE SCAN — INNER PARTS WORK
Listen to your inner Protector. Transform resistance into insight.
	

About This Tool
Inspired by Internal Family Systems (IFS), this tool helps you notice the 'Protector' parts of yourself — inner voices that resist, deflect, or overthink.
Rather than fighting these parts, you will listen to them with compassion and curiosity.
Take 2–3 minutes for each prompt. Let the part speak in short phrases or bullet points.
	

A — RESISTANCE SCAN


Name: ___________________________    Date: ___________________________
What are you going to title this journal entry?




What PART of you are you practicing attending to today? (See the 'Protectors')






At this moment, why has this PART prompted you to reflect?






What is the story you are telling yourself about this PART of you? (Try it in the third person.)






What single-word FEELINGS arise when you tell yourself that story?






What other specific THOUGHTS arise when you tell yourself that story?








Now that you have shared about this PART...
Let us give it the chance to speak for itself.
Take three deep breaths. Ready to hear what this part has been waiting to tell you?
Answer the following prompts from the perspective of your Protector PART — with compassion and curiosity.
	

B — THE PART SPEAKS


"Dear [YOUR NAME], as your [PROTECTOR'S NAME]..."
1. My Clear Throat wants you to know these Real Facts: (What does this Part want to honestly communicate?)






2. My Open Heart wants you to hear my Raw Feelings: (What emotion is this part holding — without judgment?)






3. My Intuitive Gut says this is a Relevant Focus: (What seems most important or worth noticing?)






4. My Engaged Hips desire this Resulting Fruit: (What concrete outcome does this part truly want for you?)








Stepping back: What is the INSIGHT or LESSON you are taking from this experience with this part?








What IMMEDIATE ACTION will you take to honor what this part has communicated?






